Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 6
branch_id: 6
{
  "usernameOrEmail": "charlie.white@example.com"
}
### 4. Owner ยืนยัน OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/owner/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
